=== 9a16e60d83
shader: lower Ampere TLD4 per-tap offsets

Welcome Tour's TLD4.PTP carries per-tap offsets: bit 77 of the native
instruction, with the two coordinates in Ra, Ra+1 and the four taps'
packed offsets in Rb, Rb+1. Maxwell TLD4 has the same thing as PTP, so
copy both offset registers to the meta registers and set the offset mode
to 2 instead of rejecting the program (the pixel shader of its first 3D
draw was skipped).

