=== 77bec76845
vulkan: order compute writes before later draws, indirect reads and idle waits

Ports the Vulkan part of zortos293/Lichii#295.

- The barrier before a dispatch also covers DRAW_INDIRECT, and the indirect
  dispatch path now has one.
- The scheduler records pending compute writes and the next render pass begins
  after a COMPUTE_SHADER to ALL_GRAPHICS barrier.
- Wait-for-idle is a pipeline barrier to ALL_COMMANDS with a memory barrier;
  the old event was set once and never reset, and made no write visible.

