=== cc0fc78005
core: serialize GPU dirty memory gathers

FlushRegion invalidates the GPU cache before downloading, so Gather also runs off the GPU thread, e.g. from host1x when a video decoder reads a frame. Two gatherers could swap or clear front_buffer while the other iterated it, handing the buffer cache a garbage address. Hold a gather mutex for the whole Gather; Collect keeps using guard only.

