=== 9b27d7eac8
shader: apply F2I constant-buffer abs and neg

F2I with a constant-buffer source dropped bits 62 and 63. nvdisasm prints
them as |c[..]| and -c[..] for these forms as it does for the register form,
so the lowering converted the raw constant where the program asked for its
absolute value or negation. Pokopia's logged F2I.U16 already carries bit 62.

They now go through the constant-buffer load (LOP32I AND / XOR on the loaded
value), the way the register form applies them. The uniform-register form is
unchanged. Pipeline cache versions bumped (Vulkan 28, OpenGL 25).

Ported from Lichii 8f8a234069 (upstream issue #387 reported the gap); this
tree's F2I arm differs, so only the constant-buffer modifiers are taken.

