=== 727a9a4eb4
video_core: run front-side buffer flushes on the GPU split back thread

Since the batched queue submissions, a drained back thread still submits
from its idle hook (Scheduler::FlushDeferred). The front flushed GPU-written
command list and semaphore pages itself after a drain, so its buffer
download recorded into the Vulkan scheduler while the back swapped the
command chunk out in DispatchWork: a null+0x10 read on the GPU thread.

GpuSplit::Run defers the flush to the back and waits for it; it runs
inline when already on the back or with the split inactive.

