=== bb5998f497
shader: lower Ocarina CALL helpers, 64-bit shifts and high uniform forms

Ported from zortos293/Lichii a4cc1e680f (fix/oot-bloom).

Capture now treats CALL.REL.NOINC as a call, as the lowering already
does, so a program whose helpers sit past the EXIT ends at the last RET
instead of running into the next program. USHF and SHF.R.U64 lower to a
full 64-bit right shift clamped at 64, and Maxwell SHR clamps an
unsigned shift of 32 or more to zero instead of sign-filling. USEL takes
a UPn guard. UBREV, UFLO and UPOPC map every uniform register, and
UPOPC marks the program as using the uniform bank.

The bounded-control call-proof changes are not ported; Eglantine does
not have that analysis.

