=== 785acf7042
nvhost_as_gpu: share Switch 2 device ranges between a process's address spaces

Each address space allocated its own SMMU range for the same memory
outside the heap. The caches key memory by device address, so these were
separate copies, and presentation used whichever range was recorded
last: A game drew into one alias while VI showed
another, and the screen stayed black.

