Debugging Switch 2 titles on a phone means relaunching the same loose
ExeFS folder many times. EmulationActivity now takes an exefs_path extra
(the game folder or its exefs folder), so a run can be started over adb:

  am start -n <package>/org.yuzu.yuzu_emu.activities.EmulationActivity \
      --es exefs_path /sdcard/<game folder>

The folder lookup moves to GameHelper and is shared with the folder
picker entry.

