=== ca26c70bcc
video_core: bind more than 16 storage buffers per stage

Switch 2 compute shaders bind 18. Bindings past 16 were dropped twice:
by NUM_STORAGE_BUFFERS and, on Qualcomm/ARM, by the dynamic storage
buffer limit, which doesn't apply since pipelines use plain storage
buffer descriptors. A dropped binding shifts every later descriptor of
the pipeline, and Adreno crashes in vkUpdateDescriptorSetWithTemplate.

