=== 73f25533ad
rasterizer: declare PendingSemaphoreRelease on the backend interface

The semaphore-trigger path asks the backend whether a release it already processed may still be waiting for the host GPU to write its value. Vulkan overrides it; every other backend keeps the old behaviour through the default.\

