The 0xb6c guard demanded word 2 hold exactly 0x001e0f00, but bit 90 (word
2 bit 26) is the sign of the LOD, which the emit already copies into
Maxwell's TXD. Splatoon Raiders samples with it set, so its two gradient
textures were rejected and their draws skipped.

