vulkan: re-compress ASTC to BC3 for Switch 2 titles under 12 GiB

Uncompressed ASTC does not fit: use BC3 for the session (per-game value, the
configuration file is untouched) and say so in the log. EDEN_NX2_KEEP_ASTC=1
keeps the configured setting.

