=== f42b9186ca
texture_cache: keep Switch 2 thresholds under the main heap's budget

The budget was the sum of every heap's, which on AMD counts the host-visible
device-local heap on top of the VRAM it shares: the critical threshold stayed
above the heap the images fill and allocations went past the budget (unbacked
images). Use the main device-local heap's budget, re-read every 30 frames,
with critical/expected at min(budget/8, 1 GiB) and twice that under it.

EDEN_NX2_VRAM_LIMIT_MIB=<n> limits the device-local heaps (VMA heap size
limit, budget, available VRAM) to test small cards.

