vulkan: write the driver pipeline cache atomically; reject truncated ones

The emulator stopped while saving vulkan_pipelines.bin left it empty, and
every later boot terminated: the header read throws ios_base::failure,
and macOS's libc++ throws one the handler's type doesn't match. Write the
cache to a temporary file and rename it over the old one, and treat a
