=== 186dd2b105
nx2: fold bank 1 reads of cached native programs as live ones

Live native programs (graphics and compute) are built with is_proprietary_driver set, which
folds bank 1 constant reads into the values recorded with them, but the disk cache set it only
for texture_bound == 2: a replayed native pipeline read bank 1 at run time instead and was not
the shader that had been built live. FileEnvironment now also sets it for code that carries a
native address map (every lowered program does).

