Notes: title 1 rows 92-98 (colour cast, terrain, sin/cos, movie abort, pop-in, frame rate)

=== e69090383e
Performance diagnostics and small wins for title 1

- eden-cli: SDL called SDL_AppIterate back to back, keeping a host core at
