=== 64c39aa0b7
Switch 2 shaders: MUFU.SIN/COS take turns, Eden's Maxwell MUFU radians

SM70+ removed RRO: compilers multiply the angle by 1/2pi (FMUL.RZ by
0.15915494) and MUFU.SIN/COS compute sin/cos(2pi x). Eden's Maxwell MUFU
computes sin/cos of radians (its RRO is a plain move), so every lowered sine
and cosine used the wrong angle (wind animation, rotations, the ocean FFT
twiddles). Scale the operand by 2pi first.

