Several debug switches were read with std::getenv on every macro call, QMD,
semaphore write or draw. The UCRT getenv locks and scans the environment,
thousands of times a frame; a long EDEN_NX2_KEY_SCRIPT made title 4 crawl
at 2 fps. Each is now read once. EDEN_NX2_KEY_SCRIPT=@<file> reads the
